  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_0b63c3c0-86ce-4730-8b10-47be1b2cf3fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uQWvVPRHOM0?si=A_6Yw0_4DdxGRxIQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9wKugA7QeQI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>最新 <strong>Epic Fight</strong> 整合包！您将体验到最尖端的 Epic Fight 扩展模组与 Boss，完美适配 Epic Fight！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fP1nero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_a0578524-24fb-4dc7-a337-158912ec7065.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"141\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>注意事项：</strong></span></h1>\n<p>推荐内存：<strong> </strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>8GB+</strong></span></p>\n<p>不建议与好友在同一<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>FTB Party 队伍</strong></span>中游玩此整合包。如果绑定到同一个 FTB Party 队伍，所有主线任务进度将在队伍内共享，故事中的所有选择也将跨队伍同步，未在线的玩家可能会错过重要物品！</p>\n<p>我们使用<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armourers-workshop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">armourers-workshop</a></span> </strong>作为我们的皮肤模组。我们没有内置皮肤；所有皮肤都需要从全球资源库获取或自行制作。<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>预告片中展示的部分皮肤并未公开！</strong></span> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/UfVF8b2GFk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>加入我们的 Discord 获取更多免费皮肤！</strong></span></a></p>\n<p>如果您在<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>[Linux]</strong></span>系统上游玩，请<strong>移除<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a></span> </span>模组或在环境变量中设置<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">ALSOFT_DRIVERS=pulse </span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>剧情简介</h1>\n<p>在本整合包中，您将扮演来自异界的救世主，聆听守望者的指引，击败各路 Boss，找回失落的火花并点亮祭坛！最终挑战最终 Boss，拯救世界！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9c6ad12b-e106-4cfb-9a34-5372d6deacba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>特色亮点&hellip;</h1>\n<h2><strong>自定义对话与任务系统，拥有完整的故事线</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_1714559d-5b29-41d8-8885-b36d683b6541.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_053baf49-c3d7-4322-80f0-95e19eb966d2.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<h2><strong>类魂战斗系统<img> 与沉浸式教程</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_450795cb-b1f6-4f66-9d63-3b3ffbd8ca4a.gif\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<h2><strong>搭载新一代 EpicFight 扩展模组，包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Nightfall 3.0</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WeaponsOfMiracle2.0</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sword-soaring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwordSoaring</a>。</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1343/729/569b8cca4ad3be23a1d734e17b9207b5-png.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/65/1c7bfa5de092b2bdd8223d617b52ae61-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<h2><strong>种类繁多的自定义 Boss，完全基于 Epic Fight 打造</strong></h2>\n<p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_272a5528-2a21-43ca-ae29-392fe3ce2b46.gif\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<h2><strong>史诗级中央枢纽</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_75d3a718-44d1-4dd5-81aa-f809d3f5825d.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/P1nero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"213\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UfVF8b2GFk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"220\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/P1neapplell0/TCRCore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<h1>致翻译者</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>新版本中的翻译可能已过时！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://github.com/P1neapplell0/TCRCore/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[点击此处]</a></span> 协助我们进行翻译！感谢所有翻译者！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>翻译贡献者：</strong></span></p>\n<p>（排名不分先后）</p>\n<p><strong>v2.0</strong></p>\n<p>西班牙语 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-casket-of-reveries-spanish-translation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[点击此处！]spanish-translation</a></strong></p>\n<p>越南语&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/cattfan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cattfan</a> 、<a href=\"https://github.com/bravos2k5\" rel=\"nofollow\">bravos2k5</a></strong></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙语<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/gabriellima666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gabriellima666</a></strong></p>\n<p>韩语<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/PerFectCode0425\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PerFectCode0425</a></strong></p>\n<p>印尼语<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/1stsayazaki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1stsayazaki</a></strong></p>\n<p>俄语<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/DJDemin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DJDEMIN</a> 与 <a href=\"https://github.com/fimkov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">fimkov</a></strong></p>\n<p>日语<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/syouyu26-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">syouyu26-ui</a> </strong></p>\n<p>墨西哥西班牙语 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Jotsalv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jotsalv</a></strong></p>\n<p>意大利语<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/marcosaini\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">marcosaini</a></strong></p>\n<p>土耳其语<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/yagizomerk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yagizomerk</a></strong></p>\n<p>法语<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sofiane-77\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sofiane-77</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>v1.0 ~ v1.7.13.2</strong></p>\n<p>日语&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Tr1g7av\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Tr1g7av</strong></a></p>\n<p>韩语 <a href=\"https://github.com/TheOnlyMann\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>TheOnlyMann</strong></a></p>\n<p>法语 <a href=\"https://github.com/NshiroSama\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NshiroSama</strong></a></p>\n<p>印尼语&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/mriilah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>mriilah</strong></a></p>\n<p>越南语&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/hoaanhmine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HMFNF</a></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>俄语 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/GaylordFockerCN/TCRCore/commits?author=lacrite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lacrite</a></strong></p>\n<p>西班牙语 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/pako-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pako-art</a></strong></p>\n<p>智利西班牙语 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/valentin-marquez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">valentin-marquez</a></strong></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙语 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/gabriellima666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gabriellima666</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
